{"f":{"21":{"n":"Booty Bay","i":1,"b":[[255,0,500,0]],"p":169,"d":"This booming coastal city is run by Baron Revilgaz of the Blackwater Raiders.  Mortal enemies of the Bloodsail Buccaneers and part of the Steamwheedle Cartel."},"47":{"n":"Ironforge","i":20,"b":[[73,0,3100,17],[178,0,-42000,6],[4,0,4000,17]],"p":469,"d":"This Alliance capital is the pride of the Dun Morogh dwarves.  Home to King Magni."},"54":{"n":"Gnomeregan Exiles","i":18,"b":[[13,0,3100,17],[178,0,-42000,6],[64,0,4000,17]],"p":469,"d":"The former denizens of Gnomeregan, now living in exile in Ironforge and in league with the Alliance."},"59":{"n":"Thorium Brotherhood","i":4,"b":[[255,0,0,16]],"d":"The dwarves of the Thorium Brotherhood epitomize excellence in craftsmanship and are bent on unlocking the secrets of Blackrock Mountain."},"67":{"n":"Horde","i":12,"b":[[178,0,3500,9],[77,0,-42000,14]]},"68":{"n":"Undercity","i":17,"b":[[162,0,500,17],[77,0,-42000,6],[16,0,4000,17]],"p":67,"d":"Led by Sylvanas Windrunner, the Forsaken have joined a tenuous alliance with the Horde and established this capital in the vast depths under the Ruins of Lordaeron."},"69":{"n":"Darnassus","i":21,"b":[[69,0,3100,17],[178,0,-42000,6],[8,0,4000,17]],"p":469,"d":"The Alliance capital is populated by Night Elves and is located in the island of Teldrassil.  Ruled by the Priestess of the Moon, Tyrande Whisperwind."},"70":{"n":"Syndicate","i":6,"b":[[255,0,-10000,2]],"d":"A primarily human criminal organization that operates mostly out of the Alterac Mountains and Hillsbrad Foothills."},"72":{"n":"Stormwind","i":19,"b":[[76,0,3100,17],[178,0,-42000,6],[1,0,4000,17]],"p":469,"d":"One of the last bastions of human power, this Alliance capital is ruled by the child king, Anduin Wrynn."},"76":{"n":"Orgrimmar","i":14,"b":[[160,0,3100,17],[77,0,-42000,6],[2,0,4000,17],[16,0,500,17]],"p":67,"d":"Founded by Thrall, this Horde capital city is home to many of the proud orc clans of Durotar."},"81":{"n":"Thunder Bluff","i":16,"b":[[130,0,3100,17],[77,0,-42000,6],[16,0,500,17],[32,0,4000,17]],"p":67,"d":"Cairne Bloodhoof leads his people, the Proud Tauren, from this mighty Horde capital."},"87":{"n":"Bloodsail Buccaneers","i":0,"b":[[255,0,-6500,2]],"d":"These bloodthirsty corsairs are the bane of many a merchant in the high seas.  Sworn enemies of Booty Bay."},"92":{"n":"Gelkis Clan Centaur","i":2,"b":[[255,0,2000,2]],"d":"These centaur have made their home in the southern region of Desolace.  Mortal enemies of the Magram Centaur."},"93":{"n":"Magram Clan Centaur","i":3,"b":[[255,0,2000,2]],"d":"These centaur have made their home in the eastern region of Desolace.  Mortal enemies of the Gelkis Centaur."},"169":{"n":"Steamwheedle Cartel","i":10,"b":[[255,0,500,8]]},"270":{"n":"Zandalar Tribe","i":51,"b":[[255,0,0,16]],"d":"These trolls have come to Yojamba Isle in an effort to recruit help against the resurrected Blood God and his Atal'ai Priests in Zul'Gurub."},"349":{"n":"Ravenholdt","i":5,"b":[[255,0,0,0]],"d":"This guild of thieves and assassins welcomes only those of extraordinary prowess into its fold.  Sworn rivals of the Syndicate."},"369":{"n":"Gadgetzan","i":7,"b":[[255,0,500,0]],"p":169,"d":"Capital of the Steamwheedle Cartel and home to goblinhood's finest engineers, alchemists and merchants."},"469":{"n":"Alliance","i":11,"b":[[77,0,3300,9],[178,0,-42000,14]]},"470":{"n":"Ratchet","i":9,"b":[[255,0,500,0]],"p":169,"d":"Part of the Steamwheedle Cartel, this goblin city provides a neutral haven for those that wish to trade goods and services in the Barrens."},"471":{"n":"Wildhammer Clan","i":8,"b":[[73,0,150,16],[178,0,-42000,22],[4,0,500,0]],"d":"Though not a part of the Alliance, the dwarves of Aerie Peak have opened their doors to it and hold the Horde as enemies."},"509":{"n":"The League of Arathor","i":53,"b":[[77,0,0,16],[178,0,-42000,2]],"p":891,"d":"The League of Arathor seeks to reclaim lost land of Arathi Basin for their benefactors in Stormwind."},"510":{"n":"The Defilers","i":52,"b":[[178,0,0,16],[77,0,-42000,2]],"p":892,"d":"The Defilers seek to claim Arathi Basin's valuable resources for the Horde."},"529":{"n":"Argent Dawn","i":13,"b":[[255,0,200,0]],"d":"An organization focused on protecting Azeroth from the threat of the Scourge.  Strongholds of the Argent Dawn can be found in the Eastern and Western Plaguelands."},"530":{"n":"Darkspear Trolls","i":15,"b":[[34,0,3100,17],[77,0,-42000,6],[16,0,500,17],[128,0,4000,17]],"p":67,"d":"This tribe of exiled trolls has joined forces with Thrall and the Horde.  They now call Durotar their home, which they share with their orc allies."},"574":{"n":"Caer Darrow","i":34,"b":[[255,0,0,4]]},"576":{"n":"Timbermaw Hold","i":35,"b":[[255,0,-3500,2]],"d":"As the last uncorrupted furbolg tribe, the Timbermaw seek to preserve their spiritual ways and end the suffering of their brethren."},"577":{"n":"Everlook","i":28,"b":[[255,0,500,0]],"p":169,"d":"This trading post is run by the goblins of the Steamwheedle Cartel and it sits in the crossroads of Winterspring's main trade routes."},"589":{"n":"Wintersaber Trainers","i":27,"b":[[178,0,-42000,6],[77,0,0,0]],"d":"This small group of reclusive night elves raises and trains wintersabers in the Winterspring area."},"609":{"n":"Cenarion Circle","i":36,"b":[[255,479,0,0],[40,1024,2000,0]],"d":"The druids of Cenarion Circle are guardians of nature and make their home in tranquil Moonglade."},"629":{"n":"Shatterspear Trolls","i":37,"b":[[255,0,500,0]]},"630":{"n":"Ravasaur Trainers","i":38,"b":[[178,0,0,0],[77,0,-42000,0]]},"709":{"n":"Battleground Neutral","i":39,"b":[[255,0,0,20]]},"729":{"n":"Frostwolf Clan","i":41,"b":[[178,0,0,16],[77,0,-42000,2]],"p":892,"d":"The Frostwolf Clan seeks to drive out the dwarves of the Stormpike Expedition from Alterac Valley."},"730":{"n":"Stormpike Guard","i":40,"b":[[77,0,0,16],[178,0,-42000,2]],"p":891,"d":"The Stormpike Dwarves have set up residence in Alterac Valley, where they're locked in battle with the Frostwolf Orcs."},"749":{"n":"Hydraxian Waterlords","i":42,"b":[[255,0,0,0]],"d":"These elementals have made their home on the islands east of Azshara.  Sworn enemies of the armies of Ragnaros."},"789":{"n":"Moro'gai","i":43,"b":[[255,0,0,16]]},"809":{"n":"Shen'dralar","i":44,"b":[[255,0,0,16]],"d":"A remnant of the once powerful elves living in Dire Maul, yet still wise and knowledgeable about great secrets."},"889":{"n":"Warsong Outriders","i":46,"b":[[178,0,0,16],[77,0,-42000,6]],"p":892,"d":"Fierce orcs of the Warsong Clan, locked in battle against the Silverwing Sentinels in Warsong Gulch."},"890":{"n":"Silverwing Sentinels","i":45,"b":[[77,0,0,16],[178,0,-42000,6]],"p":891,"d":"Staunch defenders of Ashenvale, locked in battle against the Warsong Outriders in Warsong Gulch."},"891":{"n":"Alliance Forces","i":47,"b":[[77,0,0,24],[178,0,-42000,14]]},"892":{"n":"Horde Forces","i":48,"b":[[178,0,0,24],[77,0,-42000,14]]},"909":{"n":"Darkmoon Faire","i":50,"b":[[255,0,0,16]],"d":"A traveling fair that showcases the weird and the extraordinary.  Often spotted in Elwynn Forest and Mulgore."},"910":{"n":"Brood of Nozdormu","i":54,"b":[[255,0,-42000,0]],"d":"The descendants of the Bronze Dragonflight are the guardians of time and care little for the mortal races."}},"kill":{"674":[21,25,5,0,0,0,0,0,0],"675":[21,25,5,0,0,0,0,0,0],"677":[21,25,5,0,0,0,0,0,0],"737":[87,5,5,0,169,-25,7,0,0],"773":[87,5,5,0,169,-25,7,0,0],"921":[21,5,6,0,0,0,0,0,0],"1094":[21,25,5,0,0,0,0,0,0],"1095":[21,25,5,0,0,0,0,0,0],"1096":[21,25,5,0,0,0,0,0,0],"1097":[21,25,5,0,0,0,0,0,0],"1411":[87,5,5,0,169,-25,7,0,0],"1561":[21,5,3,0,87,-25,7,0,0],"1562":[21,5,3,0,87,-25,7,0,0],"1563":[21,5,3,0,87,-25,7,0,0],"1564":[21,5,3,0,87,-25,7,0,0],"1565":[21,5,3,0,87,-25,7,0,0],"1653":[21,5,3,0,87,-25,7,0,0],"1783":[529,5,4,0,0,0,0,0,0],"1784":[529,5,4,0,0,0,0,0,0],"1785":[529,5,4,0,0,0,0,0,0],"1787":[529,5,4,0,0,0,0,0,0],"1788":[529,5,4,0,0,0,0,0,0],"1789":[529,5,4,0,0,0,0,0,0],"1791":[529,5,4,0,0,0,0,0,0],"1793":